WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:49.920
Someone once said...

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.690
There are lychee that grow blond hair

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:55.920
and seem to give off a shallow playboy vibe,

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.920
Wassup?!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:59.730
but have an exquisite sweet taste...

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:02.930
Shallychee!

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:10.970
If you eat a certain kind of acerola, 
its taste will make you happy,

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:17.410
as will its heart shape...

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:20.680
Cheeryola!

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:22.950
Happy!\

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:24.220
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:29.460
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:35.730
Toriko and friends went searching 
for the missing Mr. Patch.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:39.500
They discovered him and the Sweet 
Nectar Tree in a freezing forest.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:45.000
The whole gang pitched in to decorate 
the tree with a variety of ingredients,

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.980
making it into an edible Christmas tree.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:57.080
Merry Feastmas! Gourmet Santa's Present!

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.560
Alright! Are we all ready?

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.030
Not only do you not let us eat the tree,

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:13.130
now you say there's another 
job for us?! What the hell?!

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:15.430
I've got my own place to go to...

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:18.000
And why are we in the Santa suits again?

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:20.440
Did you just say "handsome"?

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.370
No!

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:24.910
Today is Christmas, which only 
comes around once a year.

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:27.980
And we're going to deliver 
presents of food to children

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.550
in countries that aren't 
member nations of IGO.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:32.080
To those kids,

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:35.450
we really will be Santa Clauses!

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:39.060
The president is the one 
who started this tradition,

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:43.190
but while he's away, we're 
going to take the reins!

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:48.730
For this year, we've cut up the 
Dessert Tree that you guys created

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:51.940
and we'll deliver the pieces.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:55.110
It'll be a wonderful Christmas cake!

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.410
So that's what that was about...

00:03:57.410 --> 00:04:01.380
But I see that Zebra didn't show up, huh?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:04.950
He still has his release conditions 
to fulfill for Honey Prison.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.180
The guy's gotta be busy.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.980
He finished with that business ages ago.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.690
Apparently, shortly after his release,

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:13.620
he sent over 100 new kinds of ingredients

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:17.830
and 500 Gourmet wanted felons.

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:21.460
It seems over half of the miscreants 
were at the brink of death.

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:24.730
As always, he displays not 
a single hint of class!

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:26.170
I hear that right now

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:30.170
he's busting his tail to put 
together his own Full Course,

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:33.480
though it's hard to picture him 
having any interest in that.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:35.080
That Zebra...

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.480
Ah, well...

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:41.880
Ricky!

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:47.360
Has Ricky gotten even bigger?!

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:49.460
It's more than that...

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:51.030
Can you tell?

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.600
As he's grown, so has his raw power.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:56.630
Right now, I'd say his Capture 
Level is 70, more or less.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.900
And Ricky's gonna keep on gettin' stronger!

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:02.470
When it comes to growin', 
he doesn't beat Terry!

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:04.640
Though I don't know its Capture Level...

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:08.640
Terry's DNA is from the 
King of the Gourmet World.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.950
So of course it's gonna get big.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:15.450
Coco's bird is an Emperor Crow, 
the Gang Leader of the Sky.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:20.320
Sunny has a legendary Mother Snake.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:23.520
You've all got great partners.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.530
If they clash with Beasts from 
the Gourmet World one day,

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.960
I bet they'll more than hold their own.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:28.960
Yep.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:30.330
Terry...

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:33.400
What do you say we load up the packages?

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:36.140
Alright! Put it down right there!

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:43.110
Toriko...

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.750
The plan has changed slightly.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:47.710
The place we're supposed to go...

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.280
Yeah, I know.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.720
Let's go after we finish this job.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:55.320
A place that has an ingredient 
the old man requested...

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:57.290
The world's biggest gambling center...

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:00.330
Gourmet Casino!

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:03.860
Okay!

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:09.100
It looks like everyone's loaded up.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.900
Are we about ready to take off?

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:12.640
I'm going with Toriko!

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:14.310
Hey, come on!

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.610
In that case, kid...

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.880
...how about sharin' the ride with me?

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.010
With you, Chief?

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.350
Alright...

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.280
Gourmet Santas, move out!

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:24.150
Yeah!

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:25.620
Yay!

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:27.190
Gourmet Santas?!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:28.350
What?!

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.120
Everyone got it?! I'm counting on you!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:38.730
IGO really does all kinds of things, huh?

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:41.570
IGO has three main duties.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.000
The first is discovering new ingredients.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:48.070
The second is researching and 
developing those ingredients.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:52.180
And the third is distributing and 
maintaining the security of those ingredients.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.780
The working capital for that

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:58.220
is provided via a Gourmet tax 
collected from member nations.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:06:59.920
In exchange, the member nations

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:03.720
are guaranteed safe distribution 
of the ingredients,

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:09.330
but IGO also distributes ingredients 
to poor non-member nations.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:14.700
The capital for that comes from the huge 
gambling proceeds of the Gourmet Coliseum.

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:16.130
I see.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:19.670
You use that money to deliver 
ingredients on Christmas...

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:23.310
Yeah. 'Cause there are 
still many poor countries.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.180
Come to think of it,

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:27.810
Toriko and the others originally 
came from a poor country.

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.350
Really?

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.920
This brings back memories...

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:36.120
I'll never forget the first day we met...

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:40.060
It's hard to picture Toriko-san 
growing up poor...

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:41.920
That reminds me, kid!

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:44.130
The Mors Oil you discovered...

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:47.730
Apparently, it's been recognized 
as a new kind of natural seasoning.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.470
For real?!

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:50.570
Yeah.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.970
I gather it's a high quality oil.

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:53.940
Yep!

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:56.740
The Shining Gourami was delicious 
when I fried it in that oil.

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:58.670
You know, I wouldn't be surprised

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:02.140
if this landed you in the 
top 100 chef ranking!

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:03.450
What?!

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:06.250
Me, in the top 100?!

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:09.320
Oh, no, I've got a ways to go yet!

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:13.360
No, I don't mean your talent as 
much as moving up in the ranks...

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:15.820
Not because of my talent...

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:18.460
But what do you mean by 
"moving up in the ranks"?

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:20.960
Well, there's a lot going on...

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.160
But be happy!

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:25.670
If you crack the top 100, you can 
participate in that cooking festival.

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:27.840
Cooking fest?!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.740
It's like a dream come true!

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:36.010
That was the best Christmas 
present you could've gotten, huh?

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.880
Getting to go on a date with 
Toriko, just the two of us...

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:43.380
I'm almost too happy!

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:45.720
I told you, this isn't a date!

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.560
Uh-oh... What if this is just a dream?!

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.760
Ow... It's no dream!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.600
We're headed for the town of Rigg.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.630
It's a real destitute place.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:58.430
How long is it gonna take to get there?

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:02.970
Terry's traveling at max speed right 
now, over 350 kilometers an hour.

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:04.370
So we should be there soon.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:05.970
By the way, Toriko...

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:10.540
Before, you said you didn't 
know Terry's Capture Level,

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.440
but look at this.

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.280
What is it?

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.680
It's a device that measures Capture Levels.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.120
It's still in the development stage,

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.250
but for example, the highest Capture Level

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.890
they can measure at the Gourmet 
Coliseum is 100, right?

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.260
Yeah,

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:26.960
since 100 is the highest level for 
a Beast found in the Human World.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.890
Well, once this calculator is perfected,

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:31.800
you'll be able to measure 
Capture Levels above 100!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:32.930
Really?!

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:37.140
Then with that you could tell the Capture 
Level of Gourmet World Beasts, too!

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:42.340
Yep! So let's test it out now, see 
if it can measure Terry's level.

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:44.910
But you said it's not completed, right?

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:46.410
Just a trial run!

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:53.080
I see it, Rin!

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:55.290
Okay, let's make our deliveries!

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:56.990
Our heaping helping of presents!

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:09.670
The town seems deserted...

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:13.870
I've been to a town that 
had once been a war zone,

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:17.070
but it looks like war 
just ended here recently.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.370
Flying Knife!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.110
Are you alright?!

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:50.910
Don't move!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.850
Flying Fork!

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.620
A biological weapon...

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:03.820
They sent them in here, too?

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:06.920
That was too close.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.860
S-Santa...

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:09.960
Are you alone?

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.560
Aren't there any other people around here?

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:13.430
I-In the center of town...

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:15.930
There aren't any biological weapons there,

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:16.930
so it's safe.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:19.740
Why did you leave them?

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:20.940
It's dangerous here!

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:23.310
My little brothers...

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:25.270
They were hungry...

00:11:25.610 --> 00:11:28.410
I couldn't stand it any more...

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:32.350
So I thought I'd get them something to eat...

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:33.620
I see...

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:36.150
But relax!

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:38.850
I brought a wonderful present.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:43.990
Up we go!

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:48.030
W-What is this?!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:49.300
It's fluffy!

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:50.870
That's my partner, Terry.

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:55.270
Okay, let's go find everyone.

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:57.400
Hang on tight!

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:01.680
Wow!

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:13.750
Alright, we're here!

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:22.860
Everyone!

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:24.300
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:26.370
Gourmet Santa has come!

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:29.000
I'll give all of you a Christmas present!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:31.900
S-Santa-san...

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:39.950
What would you like?

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:41.250
I want food!

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:42.420
I see...

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:44.680
Then eat to your heart's content!

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.120
We've got plenty to go around!

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:51.220
We've also got Yule log-style 
cake, carved from a Dessert Tree!

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:52.460
Delicious!

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.630
It tastes like all kinds of different sweets!

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:58.030
It gets sweeter the longer 
it stays in your mouth!

00:12:58.030 --> 00:13:02.100
And I love the flavors of oden and 
onigiri that come through, too!

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.470
Is this what I think it is?

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.140
Uh-huh! Mors Oil.

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:09.110
I'll heat it up to a high temperature

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:09.740
and then...

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.510
...deep-fry this thigh of a Pudding Chicken,

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:15.610
which naturally tastes like pudding...

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:17.780
Alright!

00:13:18.050 --> 00:13:19.150
It's done!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.390
Fried Pudding Chicken!

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:23.590
The sweetness of the pudding in the meat

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:28.060
has been completely sealed inside 
by the delicate yet rich Mors Oil.

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:31.530
So keep eating, everybody!

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:33.300
It's piping hot and delicious!

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:34.400
It's sweet!

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:35.830
The skin is crispy!

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.670
I'm glad they enjoy it!

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:42.710
What's wrong, Ricky?!

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:53.450
Here!

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:55.250
Eat as much as you want!

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:00.360
What a beautiful sight...

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:02.560
Yeah...

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:04.360
I just came up with a great idea.

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:08.660
I'll make it even more beautiful for you!

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:14.570
Beautiful! It looks like a Christmas tree!

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:16.470
I call it a Hair Tree!

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:19.140
This is the best...

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:20.510
This beautiful tree...

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.650
These smiling faces...

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:24.980
My god!

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:27.580
It's unbelievably perfect harmony!

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.220
What's wrong, Queen?

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:43.770
Don't push.

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:45.100
There's plenty.

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:54.210
Here you go.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.420
I can see good electromagnetic waves.

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:05.990
I'm positive a bright 
future is waiting for you.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:09.660
Whoa! Lucky!

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.990
Coco's fortunes always come true!

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:16.260
Thank you!

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:24.240
What's that...?

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:53.870
Bastard...

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.540
Think you're gonna eat me?!

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:00.510
Don't get cocky!

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:13.990
Come down...

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:19.360
...Thunder Noise!

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:26.060
That fish is roasted whole!

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:27.400
I don't believe it!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.770
Don't! It's dangerous!

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:35.070
What the hell do you brats want?!

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:36.470
Get lost!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:38.210
We're grateful to you.

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:44.050
Our fishermen couldn't go out because of 
that Turkey Fish, so we were in trouble.

00:16:44.180 --> 00:16:45.750
Thank you!

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.620
I don't give a damn about that crap!

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.850
Annoying brats!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.160
Delicious!

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:56.430
This meat tastes like turkey!

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.800
Yeah! It's perfect for Christmas!

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:05.770
This meat is cocky!

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:08.540
Although it's not good enough 
to be in my Full Course...

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:17.350
I'm hungry...

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:18.950
Stay still...

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:21.820
If you move, it'll only make you hungrier.

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:24.050
I'm hungry!

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:25.420
I told you...

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:27.520
There just isn't any food...

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:28.820
I'm...

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:30.190
...hungry...

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:34.560
I bet Bro will come back with food...

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:35.600
So hold on.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.470
I'm hungry!

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:41.070
I'm hungry!

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:42.910
I'm...

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:45.610
Hang in there!

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:47.780
After all,

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:50.980
Bro went in search of food without 
having anything to eat himself!

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:55.020
Hang on! Be patient 'til Bro gets back.

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:57.450
I'm sure he'll have food with him,

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:58.690
so be strong!

00:17:58.690 --> 00:18:00.090
Encouragement alone

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:01.690
doesn't put a dent in an empty stomach.

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:09.500
A thousand words isn't 
worth even one onigiri.

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:10.700
Are you okay?

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:11.700
Bro!

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:13.840
Sorry I'm late.

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:16.140
I brought over a ton of warm food.

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:18.610
S-Santa-san...

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:20.310
Today is Christmas.

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:22.780
These are presents from Gourmet Santa.

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.250
Thank you!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.480
Good for you!

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:28.050
There's a lot where that came from,

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:30.080
so bring it to your little brother, too.

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:36.160
Santa-san... It's Santa...

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:39.160
Hey, eat 'til you're filled up!

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.800
Look, there's still a ton left!

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:48.470
Eat as much as you want!

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:49.570
Here.

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:51.970
It's toasty warm!

00:18:58.210 --> 00:18:59.250
It's yummy!

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:00.680
Delicious!

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:02.750
Yeah, it is!

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:07.650
Santa-san...

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:09.920
Thank you!

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.020
Thank you!

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:14.530
Please... Please come back again next year!

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:16.200
Santa-san...

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:20.600
Yeah. I'll be back next year.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:23.000
And the year after that. 
And so on and so on...

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:24.400
I'll keep coming.

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:25.540
So you too,

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:28.210
work together with your older brothers.

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:29.810
Get stronger.

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:31.780
That's the deal.

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:37.020
Thank you, Santa-san!

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:44.460
Snow!

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:46.790
It tastes like marshmallows!

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:49.530
This is Flavored Snow, snow that's edible

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:52.060
but only falls once every several decades.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:01.710
This snow tastes like grapes!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.810
I never thought it would really snow!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:11.050
Snow that tastes like pudding!

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:14.520
Hey! Merry Christmas!

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:17.520
Unbelievable...

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:20.290
Snow that tastes like popsicles?

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:22.360
We're lucky, everyone.

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:25.360
This type of snow only falls 
once every several decades.

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.330
What is this snow?!

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.830
It tastes sweet and sour!

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:31.200
Don't you know anything?!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:33.770
This is strawberry-flavored snow.

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:37.210
You brats are stiflin' me! Back off!

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:42.250
The heavens are sharing some 
of its bounty with us, too...

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:46.820
A Gourmet Blessing that's shared 
equally with everyone...

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:51.490
I wish it would keep piling up forever.

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:57.980
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:02.220
We're going to use a camera again 
today too, so get yours ready!

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:04.760
Please choose one of these three platters.

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:09.360
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:12.130
Here we go!

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:14.470
A heaping helping...

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:16.700
Open!

00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:21.040
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:21.910 --> 00:22:26.150
C - Lightning Phoenix Capture Level 75

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:26.150
...yours if you chose C! You may 
find you're good at something new!

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:31.920
B - Sandflower Fish Capture Level 37

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:29.750
If you chose B, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:31.920
It looks like something good 
will happen on the weekend.

00:22:31.920 --> 00:22:37.420
A - Roast Banana Capture Level 1

00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:35.420
And I'm sorry. If you chose A, you're third.

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:37.020
Keep an eye on your physical condition.

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:41.030
And finally, it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:42.230
Are you ready?

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:48.170
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:44.800
If you take a photo of this scene

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:48.170
and carry it with you for a week as a 
good luck charm, you'll be even luckier!

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:49.970
Alright, here we go!

00:22:50.370 --> 00:22:54.340
Three! Two! One! Scoop chance!

00:22:54.570 --> 00:22:56.510
Did you just say "handsome"?!

00:22:57.040 --> 00:22:58.810
Did you just say "handsome"?!

00:22:59.610 --> 00:23:01.380
Did you say "handsome"?!

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:02.780
I certainly did not!

00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:04.920
And now, our next segment...

00:23:06.950 --> 00:23:11.260
In pursuit of further training and new ingredients, they head to the world's biggest gambling spot.

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:14.090
And behind the scenes, underworld organizations make their move!

00:23:14.610 --> 00:23:17.330
Heaven or Hell?! Storming Into the Gourmet Casino!

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:19.270
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
